{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/518489-wta-via-google-hangouts","id":518489,"title":"WtA via Google Hangouts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-18T15:12:13-07:00","id":518489,"title":"WtA via Google Hangouts","content":"Just figured I'd gauge interest in a WtA game to be played via Google Hangouts. I have two groups that meet pretty regularly to play Pathfinder and Numenera, so I'd have to work around that, but doubt it would be a problem. I'm a veteran storyteller of cWoD (Werewolf especially), but I'd be willing to play in someone else's game as well. Right now I have the framework in mind for a Hengeyokai chronicle set in Myanmar. But I'd be willing to pick a different setting/concept if thats what the group wanted. I've never played via Google Hangouts before, but I've heard positive things. I live in Southern NJ, and have had a hard time finding anyone interested in WoD, and the ones who are generally prefer Vampire. I'd like to start by seeing if there is any interest. If so, then we can continue the conversation and discuss play styles and everyone's expectations moving forward.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I am purposely NOT posting a date/time/timezone, etc. right now because I want to see if anyone is interested, first, and then gather information as to when everyone is available. Then we can pick a day and time that works for everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6039,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6039-mattlutz","user":"MattLutz","date":". 05-21-2015, 12:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6039-mattlutz","name":"MattLutz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T08:12:21-07:00","id":521897,"title":"","content":"I'm a big World of Darkness fan (both Classic and New), and I've never had the chance to play Werewolf: The Apocolypse. I'd be interested, but not in a Hengeyokai game. I'd like to play in one that kept to the core themes of Werewolf.<br /> <br /> Also, what day of the week, what time, and what time zone? I'm only available on Mondays, Tuesdays, and Wednesdays.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T17:08:13-07:00","id":522677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Techpriest</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/518489-wta-via-google-hangouts?p=521897#post521897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a big World of Darkness fan (both Classic and New), and I've never had the chance to play Werewolf: The Apocolypse. I'd be interested, but not in a Hengeyokai game. I'd like to play in one that kept to the core themes of Werewolf.<br /> <br /> Also, what day of the week, what time, and what time zone? I'm only available on Mondays, Tuesdays, and Wednesdays.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey thanks for the reply. You're the second person to respond. If we get enough people to where it looks like we have enough to play (I'd like at least 4 players) then we can discuss time and what not. I'm fine with running a Werewolf game. The Hengeyokai thing, for me, had more to do with wanting to challenge myself by running a game in a different culture (which I've never done). But I love Werewolf so I'm not too picky about setting. I actually already have a Caern and NPC's drawn up for a game set in Tucson, AZ.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6039-mattlutz","name":"MattLutz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T20:24:40-07:00","id":522849,"title":"","content":"You are likely to wind up with players agreeing then dropping out, if you don't post the time-zone and day of week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T09:37:48-07:00","id":523391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Techpriest</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/518489-wta-via-google-hangouts?p=522849#post522849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are likely to wind up with players agreeing then dropping out, if you don't post the time-zone and day of week.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well thats just silly. The entire reason I'm NOT posting it is because I want to see when people are available and then pick a time that is amendable to everyone. I'm not looking for a hard and fast &quot;Yes! I definitely want to play!&quot; but rather &quot;I'm interested in playing, as long as it fits my schedule.&quot; If I pick a day and time now, then there will likely be people who don't respond at all based on the fact that the day and time don't agree with them. But I did go ahead and edit my original post stating why I haven't posted a day and time yet. I'm in the Eastern Standard Timezone, but I'm still amendable to picking a time that works for people in other timezones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6039,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6039-mattlutz","user":"MattLutz","date":". 05-21-2015, 12:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6039-mattlutz","name":"MattLutz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T23:47:43-07:00","id":524068,"title":"","content":"I\u00b4d be interested to play too. The problem is, that I live in europe, and the time-zones could become a bother.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6112-seki","name":"Seki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T08:09:32-07:00","id":524440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/518489-wta-via-google-hangouts?p=524068#post524068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u00b4d be interested to play too. The problem is, that I live in europe, and the time-zones could become a bother.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are probably right, though I appreciate the interest all the same.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6039-mattlutz","name":"MattLutz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T09:26:29-07:00","id":524517,"title":"","content":"I would be interested in trying werewolf, but I am way way more familiar with 2nd Edition than I am with classic. Should you switch to the new stuff. let me know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T16:06:38-07:00","id":524864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vitalis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/518489-wta-via-google-hangouts?p=524517#post524517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would be interested in trying werewolf, but I am way way more familiar with 2nd Edition than I am with classic. Should you switch to the new stuff. let me know.</div> </div> </div> </div>By 2nd Edition, I am assuming you mean Werewolf: The Forsaken 2nd Edition (as opposed to Werewolf: The Apocalypse, 2nd Edition)? I'd be interested in trying WtF as well, but I don't feel comfortable enough with the rules or the setting to run it, at this point. But I would play in a game run by someone else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6039-mattlutz","name":"MattLutz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}